{"updated_at": {"date": {"d": "25", "m": "08", "Y": "2026"}, "time": {"H": "02", "M": "48", "S": "37"}}, "news": [{"title": "SC bans construction activity within 100 metres from edge of Rajasthan's Jojari river", "para": "In a landmark decision, the Supreme Court has imposed a ban on any construction activities within 100 metres of Rajasthan's Jojari-Bandi-Luni rivers to safeguard the environment. Additionally, hazardous industries will be restricted from operating within 500 metres of the flood line. A research initiative at National Law University, Jodhpur will delve into environmental law and community rights, funded by a grant of fifty lakh rupees.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/infrastructure/sc-bans-construction-activity-within-100-metres-from-edge-of-rajasthans-jojari-river/133473878?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-360162/133473878.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "infrastructure"}, {"title": "Goa: Development in eco fragile land, tenants issue spark Mandur gram sabha", "para": "During the recent Azossim-Mandur gram sabha meeting, attendees addressed the proposed large-scale project on Azossim hill and its potential environmental consequences. Discussions also included tenant management and issues surrounding littering in rental properties. A controversial new road route through a verdant forest was debated, alongside occupancy certificates issued previously. The sarpanch committed to tackling the deteriorating Pilar-Old Goa road and the necessary BMC reconstitution.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/infrastructure/goa-development-in-eco-fragile-land-tenants-issue-spark-mandur-gram-sabha/133460084?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-320530/133460084.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "infrastructure"}, {"title": "Delhi development body to hold over 20 meetings in three months over MPD 2047", "para": "The Delhi Development Authority is gearing up for more than twenty stakeholder meetings in the near future. These critical dialogues will hone in on executing the Master Plan for Delhi 2047, welcoming contributions from elected officials, governmental organizations, industry representatives, and local residents alike. Furthermore, updates to the Delhi Development Act are set to support the swift rollout of the land pooling policy.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/infrastructure/delhi-development-body-to-hold-over-20-meetings-in-three-months-over-mpd-2047/133460049?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-72284/133460049.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "infrastructure"}]}